{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c3b7","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a18818-8a95-7650-8f97-acf8c05d8dc6"},"sequence":54,"recorded_at":1780531400000103,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"01a18818-8eec-7e70-9235-67f86c11c7d1","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"01a18818-8eec-7e70-9235-67f86c11c7d1","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"01a18818-8eec-7e70-9235-67f86c11c7d1"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a18818-cce3-7e53-abcb-2198fad101cb"},"task_id":"01a18818-cce3-7e53-abcb-2198fad101cb","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a18818-cce3-7e53-abcb-2198fad101cb","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/aazhiry1/tmp/cli-agent-bridge/agy-universal-image-fallback/.ai-team/runs/agy-universal-image-fallback-20261029/architecture/architecture-packet.json`.\n1|{\n2|  \"schema_version\": \"1.0\",\n3|  \"protocol\": \"AP/v1\",\n4|  \"task_id\": \"agy-universal-image-fallback\",\n5|  \"run_id\": \"agy-universal-image-fallback-20261029\",\n6|  \"criticality\": \"S2\",\n7|  \"profile\": \"python-aisdlc-gcge\",\n8|  \"status\": \"APPROVED\",\n9|  \"approval_scope\": \"Author-finalized reversible design and mechanical schema/integrity gate only. No external council verdict, resource acceptance, Coder authorization or production acceptance is implied.\",\n10|  \"baseline\": {\n11|    \"branch\": \"feat/agy-universal-image-fallback\",\n12|    \"commit\": \"012da99905ec27a6133afb4f3e768ff9b4426a8f\",\n13|    \"test_prefix_bytes\": 249933,\n14|    \"test_prefix_lines\": 6008,\n15|    \"test_prefix_sha256\": \"f318d60537ad862b11313d303644ace3ff5ae74e5d581ceeba86bcf7bddeeff5\",\n16|    \"test_line_discrepancy\": \"Owner specified 1..6009; actual baseline contains 6008 lines. Preserve the ENTIRE 249933-byte blob verbatim, including trailing newline and __main__ guard; append only.\"\n17|  },\n18|  \"requirement_ids\": [\n19|    \"REQ-01\",\n20|    \"REQ-02\",\n21|    \"REQ-03\",\n22|    \"REQ-04\",\n23|    \"REQ-05\",\n24|    \"REQ-06\"\n25|  ],\n26|  \"requirements\": [\n27|    {\n28|      \"id\": \"REQ-01\",\n29|      \"statement\": \"в universal mode любой **известный каталогу** model/поддерживаемый effort принимает image request без per-model proof/SHA/efforts_proven допуска. Валидные user raster PNG/JPEG/GIF/WebP в пределах лимитов при staging=true идут в attempt1 через img_dir, `--add-dir` и attachments. Источники: постановка; разрыв F-102/F-308.\",\n30|      \"verification_ids\": [\n31|        \"VER-003\",\n32|        \"VER-007\",\n33|        \"VER-009\",\n34|        \"VER-010\"\n35|      ]\n36|    },\n37|    {\n38|      \"id\": \"REQ-02\",\n39|      \"statement\": \"ImageReject, включая malformed image content, flag-off, remote/file URLs, non-user role, unsupported MIME/base64/signature/limits, а также ImageSpoolError ведут к text-only turn в universal mode; никаких media-derived400/500 до него. Источники: постановка; F-105/F-118/F-124/F-125.\",\n40|      \"verification_ids\": [\n41|        \"VER-003\",\n42|        \"VER-005\",\n43|        \"VER-009\",\n44|        \"VER-010\"\n45|      ]\n46|    },\n47|    {\n48|      \"id\": \"REQ-03\",\n49|      \"statement\": \"если первая реально image-attached попытка вернула state не done/client_gone и delivered=false, до attempt2 убрать media, файлы, прежний CID и hot eligibility. Повтор ровно один, text-only; успешный text turn возвращает обычный200 JSON/успешный SSE. Источники: постановка; F-119..F-123/F-126.\",\n50|      \"verification_ids\": [\n51|        \"VER-003\",\n52|        \"VER-005\",\n53|        \"VER-009\",\n54|        \"VER-010\"\n55|      ]\n56|    },\n57|    {\n58|      \"id\": \"REQ-04\",\n59|      \"statement\": \"все существующие строки тестового файла неизменны; только append новых uf-тестов. Strict поведение и fleet/default constants сохраняются. Источники: постановка VER-006/007; F-203..F-218/F-314/F-315.\",\n60|      \"verification_ids\": [\n61|        \"VER-001\",\n62|        \"VER-002\",\n63|        \"VER-003\",\n64|        \"VER-004\",\n65|        \"VER-005\",\n66|        \"VER-006\",\n67|        \"VER-007\",\n68|        \"VER-008\"\n69|      ]\n70|    },\n71|    {\n72|      \"id\": \"REQ-05\",\n73|      \"statement\": \"universal acceptance и fallback фактически включены в установленном production bridge для всех catalog models. Проверка checkout/config-file или `/health` сама по себе не равна живой приёмке. Источники: постановка; F-301..F-307/F-129.\",\n74|      \"verification_ids\": [\n75|        \"VER-003\",\n76|        \"VER-008\",\n77|        \"VER-010\"\n78|      ]\n79|    },\n80|    {\n81|      \"id\": \"REQ-06\",\n82|      \"statement\": \"stripping действует на всю историю, включая media-only сообщения, dict-content и non-image media; сохраняет текст, порядок, роли и непустой безопасный запрос. Никаких media payload/URL/path/attachments-инструкций от вложений после downgrade. Источники: постановка; F-104/F-111..F-115/F-312.\",\n83|      \"verification_ids\": [\n84|        \"VER-003\",\n85|        \"VER-007\",\n86|        \"VER-009\",\n87|        \"VER-010\"\n88|      ]\n89|    }\n90|  ],\n91|  \"evidence\": [\n92|    {\n93|      \"id\": \"EVD-001\",\n94|      \"kind\": \"document\",\n95|      \"ref\": \"analysis/agy-universal-image-fallback/evidence-ledger.md#F-101\",\n96|      \"claim\": \"Image flag: env имеет приоритет; strict JSON boolean true; default false и TTL 1 s | bridges/agy-bridge/server.py:681–715 _read_image_flag/_is_image_input_enabled | 2026-10-29\",\n97|      \"source_id\": \"F-101\"\n98|    },\n99|    {\n100|      \"id\": \"EVD-002\",\n101|      \"kind\": \"document\",\n102|      \"ref\": \"analysis/agy-universal-image-fallback/evidence-ledger.md#F-102\",\n103|      \"claim\": \"Eligibility требует image input, confirmed/probe, method/proof version, formats, effort и binary SHA; _model_supports_images зависит от flag/proof | bridges/agy-bridge/server.py:718–786 _image_proof_reason/_im