oundary prevents payload leakage/fetch and filesystem cross-request deletion?\",\n1314|      \"artifact_ref\": \"architecture/architecture-packet.json#/threat_model\"\n1315|    },\n1316|    {\n1317|      \"id\": \"VIEW-003\",\n1318|      \"type\": \"deployment\",\n1319|      \"question\": \"Why is checkout config not production activation?\",\n1320|      \"artifact_ref\": \"architecture/architecture-packet.json#/evolution\"\n1321|    }\n1322|  ],\n1323|  \"risks\": [\n1324|    {\n1325|      \"id\": \"RISK-001\",\n1326|      \"source_id\": \"RISK-01\",\n1327|      \"scenario\": \"Backend/native-tool side effects may precede failure even without client delivery.\",\n1328|      \"probability\": \"medium\",\n1329|      \"impact\": \"high\",\n1330|      \"mitigation\": \"Bounded one text retry; no exactly-once claim; delivered tool/text/reasoning forbids retry; live safe read-only failure oracle; do not run destructive duplicate tool action.\",\n1331|      \"verification_ids\": [\n1332|        \"VER-003\",\n1333|        \"VER-010\"\n1334|      ]\n1335|    },\n1336|    {\n1337|      \"id\": \"RISK-002\",\n1338|      \"source_id\": \"RISK-02\",\n1339|      \"scenario\": \"Text retry/backend/auth/queue can still fail despite media-safe admission.\",\n1340|      \"probability\": \"medium\",\n1341|      \"impact\": \"high\",\n1342|      \"mitigation\": \"Only successful real text completion returns200; preserve actual JSON/SSE failures and no double headers.\",\n1343|      \"verification_ids\": [\n1344|        \"VER-003\",\n1345|        \"VER-005\"\n1346|      ]\n1347|    },\n1348|    {\n1349|      \"id\": \"RISK-003\",\n1350|      \"source_id\": \"RISK-03\",\n1351|      \"scenario\": \"done badrc/empty output and constructor exceptions do not match owner runtime guard.\",\n1352|      \"probability\": \"medium\",\n1353|      \"impact\": \"high\",\n1354|      \"mitigation\": \"Exclude done and pre-execute constructor errors; preserve mapping and one header response; test explicitly uf08.\",\n1355|      \"verification_ids\": [\n1356|        \"VER-003\"\n1357|      ]\n1358|    },\n1359|    {\n1360|      \"id\": \"RISK-004\",\n1361|      \"source_id\": \"RISK-04\",\n1362|      \"scenario\": \"Pixel decoder can break magic-only strict fixtures or admit decompression bombs.\",\n1363|      \"probability\": \"medium\",\n1364|      \"impact\": \"high\",\n1365|      \"mitigation\": \"No new pixel decoder; signature and byte safety unchanged; real decodable positive corpus does not assert arbitrary pixel validity.\",\n1366|      \"verification_ids\": [\n1367|        \"VER-003\",\n1368|        \"VER-006\"\n1369|      ]\n1370|    },\n1371|    {\n1372|      \"id\": \"RISK-005\",\n1373|      \"source_id\": \"RISK-05\",\n1374|      \"scenario\": \"Flag cache leaks fixture/policy state or hot CID survives stripping.\",\n1375|      \"probability\": \"medium\",\n1376|      \"impact\": \"high\",\n1377|      \"mitigation\": \"Independent cache reset; consistent universal snapshot, input recheck, env contexts, full stripped prompts and owner-safe CID reset.\",\n1378|      \"verification_ids\": [\n1379|        \"VER-003\",\n1380|        \"VER-009\"\n1381|      ]\n1382|    },\n1383|    {\n1384|      \"id\": \"RISK-006\",\n1385|      \"source_id\": \"RISK-06\",\n1386|      \"scenario\": \"Checkout, deployed runtime and config diverge.\",\n1387|      \"probability\": \"medium\",\n1388|      \"impact\": \"high\",\n1389|      \"mitigation\": \"Pair hash readback, actual deployed ROOT booleans; controlled code restart then dynamic rollback and same-owner live receipt.\",\n1390|      \"verification_ids\": [\n1391|        \"VER-008\",\n1392|        \"VER-010\"\n1393|      ]\n1394|    },\n1395|    {\n1396|      \"id\": \"RISK-007\",\n1397|      \"source_id\": \"RISK-07\",\n1398|      \"scenario\": \"Universal mode accidentally bypasses body/connection/admission safety.\",\n1399|      \"probability\": \"medium\",\n1400|      \"impact\": \"high\",\n1401|      \"mitigation\": \"Ingress auth/framing/model/effort/body limits run before media fallback unchanged; whole-request strip never means unlimited parsing/fetching.\",\n1402|      \"verification_ids\": [\n1403|        \"VER-003\",\n1404|        \"VER-005\",\n1405|        \"VER-009\"\n1406|      ]\n1407|    },\n1408|    {\n1409|      \"id\": \"RISK-008\",\n1410|      \"source_id\": \"RISK-08\",\n1411|      \"scenario\": \"No measured quota/RPS/p99/memory/CPU/FD budget, plus reserve allows up to2N CLI executions.\",\n1412|      \"probability\": \"medium\",\n1413|      \"impact\": \"high\",\n1414|      \"mitigation\": \"Record all46 HL fields with UNKNOWN facts; no capacity PASS; require release resource measurement and owner quota/SLA before production acceptance. Do not claim generic retry bound for universal reserve.\",\n1415|      \"verification_ids\": [\n1416|        \"VER-003\",\n1417|        \"VER-010\"\n1418|      ]\n1419|    }\n1420|  ],\n1421|  \"verification_surface\": [\n1422|    {\n1423|      \"id\": \"VER-001\",\n1424|      \"requirement_ids\": [\n1425|        \"REQ-04\"\n1426|      ],\n1427|      \"kind\": \"command\",\n1428|      \"command\": \"run-guarded -- env uvx ruff@0.17.3 check --no-cache bridges/agy-bridge/server.py tests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py\",\n1429|      \"expected\": \"exit 0; no lint errors; never use --fix on frozen baseline\",\n1430|      \"environment\": \"cwd=repo_root; after Coder, independent clean-room worktree; unset AGY_IMAGE_FALLBACK_ENABLED except scoped tests; PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1. Not executed during Stage2.\",\n1431|      \"owner\": \"Verifier\"\n1432|    },\n1433|    {\n1434|      \"id\": \"VER-002\",\n1435|      \"requirement_ids\": [\n1436|        \"REQ-04\"\n1437|      ],\n1438|      \"kind\": \"command\",\n1439|      \"command\": \"run-guarded -- env uvx ruff@0.17.3 format --check --no-cache bridges/agy-bridge/server.py tests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py\",\n1440|      \"expected\": \"exit 0; no formatting writes to original prefix\",\n1441|      \"environment\": \"cwd=repo_root; after Coder, independent clean-room worktree; unset AGY_IMAGE_FALLBACK_ENABLED except scoped tests; PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1. Not executed during Stage2.\",\n1442|      \"owner\": \"Verifier\"\n1443|    },\n1444|    {\n1445|      \"id\": \"VER-003\",\n1446|      \"requirement_ids\": [\n1447|        \"REQ-01\",\n1448|        \"REQ-02\",\n1449|        \"REQ-03\",\n1450|        \"REQ-04\",\n1451|        \"REQ-05\",\n1452|        \"REQ-06\"\n1453|      ],\n1454|      \"kind\": \"command\",\n1455|      \"command\": \"run-guarded -- env PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 -B -c 'import importlib.util, os, sys, unittest\\nos.environ.pop(\\\"AGY_IMAGE_FALLBACK_ENABLED\\\", None)\\nsys.path.insert(0, \\\"tests\\\"); sys.path.insert(0, \\\".\\\")\\nspec=importlib.util.spec_from_file_location(\\\"agy_frozen_suite\\\", \\\"tests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py\\\")\\nm=importlib.util.module_from_spec(spec); sys.modules[spec.name]=m; spec.loader.exec_module(m)\\nclasses=[c for n,c in vars(m).items() if isinstance(c,type) and issubclass(c,unittest.TestCase) and (n.startswith(\\\"Image\\\") or n in {\\\"AcceptanceOracleTests\\\",\\\"UniversalImageFallbackTests\\\"})]\\nassert any(c.__name__==\\\"UniversalImageFallbackTests\\\" for c in classes), \\\"Missing universal tests\\\"\\nloader=unittest.TestLoader(); suite=unittest.TestSuite(loader.loadTestsFromTestCase(c) for c in classes)\\nassert suite.countTestCases()>=56, suite.countTestCases()\\nresult=unittest.TextTestRunner(verbosity=2).run(suite); assert result.wasSuccessful()\\nprint(\\\"UNIVERSAL_AND_LEGACY_EXECUTION_PASS\\\")'\",\n1456|      \"expected\": \">=56 tests: all 46 legacy image-related methods plus UniversalImageFallbackTests uf01..uf10 execute and pass; not AST-only\",\n1457|      \"environment\": \"cwd=repo_root; after Coder, independent clean-room worktree; unset AGY_IMAGE_FALLBACK_ENABLED except scoped tests; PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1. Not executed during Stage2.\",\n1458|      \"owner\": \"Verifier\"\n1459|    },\n1460|    {\n1461|      \"id\": \"VER-004\",\n1462|      \"requirement_ids\": [\n1463|        \"REQ-04\"\n1464|      ],\n1465|      \"kind\": \"command\",\n1466|      \"command\": \"run-guarded -- env PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 -B -c 'import collections, io, json, subprocess, tarfile, tempfile\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nroot=Path.cwd(); temp_base_dir=Path.home()/\\\"work/tmp\\\"; temp_base_dir.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\\nargs=[\\\"uvx\\\",\\\"basedpyright@1.40.2\\\",\\\"--outputjson\\\",\\\"bridges/agy-bridge/server.py\\\",\\\"tests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py\\\"]\\ndef diagnostics(cwd):\\n r=subprocess.run(args,cwd=cwd,capture_output=True,text=True)\\n assert r.returncode in (0,1),(r.returncode,r.stderr)\\n d=json.loads(r.stdout); assert \\\"generalDiagnostics\\\" in d,d\\n c=collections.Counter()\\n for x in d[\\\"generalDiagnostics\\\"]:\\n  f=str(Path(x[\\\"file\\\"]).relative_to(cwd)); c[(f,x.get(\\\"severity\\\"),x.get(\\\"rule\\\"),x[\\\"message\\\"])]+=1\\n return c\\nwith tempfile.TemporaryDirectory(prefix=\\\"agy-type-baseline-\\\",dir=temp_base_dir) as tmp:\\n old=Path(tmp); archive=subprocess.check_output([\\\"git\\\",\\\"archive\\\",'\\\"'\\\"'012da99905ec27a6133afb4f3e768ff9b4426a8f'\\\"'\\\"'])\\n with tarfile.open(fileobj=io.BytesIO(archive)) as tf: tf.extractall(old,filter=\\\"data\\\")\\n before=diagnostics(old); after=diagnostics(root); delta=after-before\\n assert not delta,dict(delta)\\n print(\\\"TYPECHECK_NO_NEW_DIAGNOSTICS_PASS\\\",\\\"baseline\\\",sum(before.values()),\\\"candidate\\\",sum(after.values()))'\",\n1467|      \"expected\": \"same pinned basedpyright executable checks archived BASE and candidate; exact multiset file/severity/rule/message delta is empty; inherited diagnostics recorded, no baseline suppression\",\n1468|      \"environment\": \"cwd=repo_root; after Coder, independent clean-room worktree; unset AGY_IMAGE_FALLBACK_ENABLED except scoped tests; PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1. Not executed during Stage2.\",\n1469|      \"owner\": \"Verifier\"\n1470|    },\n1471|    {\n1472|      \"id\": \"VER-005\",\n1473|      \"requirement_ids\": [\n1474|        \"REQ-01\",\n1475|        \"REQ-02\",\n1476|        \"REQ-03\",\n1477|        \"REQ-04\",\n1478|        \"REQ-05\",\n1479|        \"REQ-06\"\n1480|      ],\n1481|      \"kind\": \"command\",\n1482|      \"command\": \"run-guarded -- env PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 PYTHONPATH=. uvx --from pytest==9.0.3 pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider\",\n1483|      \"expected\": \"exit 0; full repository suite including all agy/strict tests. No pyproject.toml exists; use pinned uvx, do not invent uv run project config.\",\n1484|      \"environment\": \"cwd=repo_root; after Coder, independent clean-room worktree; unset AGY_IMAGE_FALLBACK_ENABLED except scoped tests; PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1. Not executed during Stage2.\",\n1485|      \"owner\": \"Verifier\"\n1486|    },\n1487|    {\n1488|      \"id\": \"VER-006\",\n1489|      \"requirement_ids\": [\n1490|        \"REQ-04\"\n1491|      ],\n1492|      \"kind\": \"command\",\n1493|      \"command\": \"run-guarded -- env PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 -B -c 'import hashlib, subprocess\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\np='\\\"'\\\"'tests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py'\\\"'\\\"'; old=subprocess.check_output([\\\"git\\\",\\\"show\\\",'\\\"'\\\"'012da99905ec27a6133afb4f3e768ff9b4426a8f'\\\"'\\\"'+\\\":\\\"+p]); new=Path(p).read_bytes()\\nassert len(old)==249933 and hashlib.sha256(old).hexdigest()=='\\\"'\\\"'f318d60537ad862b11313d303644ace3ff5ae74e5d581ceeba86bcf7bddeeff5'\\\"'\\\"'\\nassert new[:len(old)]==old, \\\"Baseline prefix changed\\\"\\nfor b in ['\\\"'\\\"'012da99905ec27a6133afb4f3e768ff9b4426a8f'\\\"'\\\"','\\\"'\\\"'5a19559426de7508d525e2bd465eff648665a6a7'\\\"'\\\"']:\\n rows=subprocess.check_output([\\\"git\\\",\\\"diff\\\",\\\"--numstat\\\",b,\\\"--\\\",p],text=True).splitlines()\\n assert all(row.split()[1]==\\\"0\\\" for row in rows), rows\\nsubprocess.run([\\\"python3\\\",\\\"-B\\\",\\\"-m\\\",\\\"unittest\\\",\\\"discover\\\",\\\"-s\\\",\\\"tests\\\",\\\"-p\\\",\\\"test_images_strict.py\\\",\\\"-q\\\"],check=True)\\nprint(\\\"APPEND_ONLY_STRICT_PASS\\\",len(old))'\",\n1494|      \"expected\": \"whole baseline blob is exact prefix; 0 deleted lines against both baselines; test_images_strict.py executes successfully\",\n1495|      \"environment\": \"cwd=repo_root; after Coder, independent clean-room worktree; unset AGY_IMAGE_FALLBACK_ENABLED except scoped tests; PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1. Not executed during Stage2.\",\n1496|      \"owner\": \"Teamlead\"\n1497|    },\n(more lines below)","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
