{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c503","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a18818-8a95-7650-8f97-acf8c05d8dc6"},"sequence":220,"recorded_at":1780531400000435,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"01a18818-8eec-7e70-9235-67f86c11c7d1","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"01a18818-8eec-7e70-9235-67f86c11c7d1","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"01a18818-8eec-7e70-9235-67f86c11c7d1"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a1881a-48c8-7b22-8e64-e0835a793507"},"task_id":"01a1881a-48c8-7b22-8e64-e0835a793507","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a1881a-48c8-7b22-8e64-e0835a793507","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-5-1\",\n  \"command\": \"cd /Users/aazhiry1/tmp/cli-agent-bridge/agy-universal-image-fallback && python3 -c \\\"\\nimport json\\nf=json.load(open('bridges/agy-bridge/fleet.json'))\\nprint(list(f.keys()))\\nfor m in f.get('models',[]):\\n    print(m.get('id'), '| keys:', sorted(m.keys()))\\n    print('  efforts-ish:', {k:v for k,v in m.items() if 'effort' in k or k=='images'})\\n\\\" ; echo ---; grep -n \\\"IMAGE_LIMITS\\\\|effort\\\" bridges/agy-bridge/server.py | head -40\",\n  \"description\": \"Проверить fleet-модели и effort-поля\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"['schema_version', 'catalogue', 'policy_ref', 'default_model', 'technical_ref', 'image_limits', 'admission', 'models']\\ngemini-4-argon | keys: ['context_window', 'default_effort', 'efforts', 'id', 'images', 'input', 'max_tokens', 'name']\\n  efforts-ish: {'efforts': ['low', 'medium', 'high'], 'default_effort': 'high', 'images': {'cli_registry': 'implicit_supported', 'status': 'confirmed', 'method': 'workspace-read', 'verified_at': '2026-10-29', 'proof': {'agy_binary_sha256': '35605054a9dc4591dd7e6ea83a9392238153d4c55d265512ed9b5b7f97cc0423', 'impl_version': 1, 'formats': ['image/png', 'image/jpeg', 'image/gif', 'image/webp'], 'efforts_proven': ['low', 'medium', 'high'], 'command': \\\"agy.real -p 'Read img-1.png' --add-dir <img_dir> --model <model> --effort <effort>\\\"}}}\\ngemini-3.8-flash | keys: ['context_window', 'default_effort', 'efforts', 'id', 'images', 'input', 'max_tokens', 'name']\\n  efforts-ish: {'efforts': ['low', 'medium', 'high'], 'default_effort': 'high', 'images': {'cli_registry': 'implicit_supported', 'status': 'confirmed', 'method': 'workspace-read', 'verified_at': '2026-10-29', 'proof': {'agy_binary_sha256': '35605054a9dc4591dd7e6ea83a9392238153d4c55d265512ed9b5b7f97cc0423', 'impl_version': 1, 'formats': ['image/png', 'image/jpeg', 'image/gif', 'image/webp'], 'efforts_proven': ['low', 'medium', 'high'], 'command': \\\"agy.real -p 'Read img-1.png' --add-dir <img_dir> --model <model> --effort <effort>\\\"}}}\\ngemini-3.7-flash | keys: ['context_window', 'default_effort', 'efforts', 'id', 'images', 'input', 'max_tokens', 'name']\\n  efforts-ish: {'efforts': ['low', 'medium', 'high'], 'default_effort': 'high', 'images': {'cli_registry': 'explicit_unsupported', 'status': 'unsupported', 'method': None, 'proof': 'agy 1.3.1 stream-json принимает только текстовые блоки контента; image_url отвергается: error: stream input content block type \\\"image_url\\\" is not supported (only \\\"text\\\") — проверено 2026-10-07'}}\\ngemini-3.6-flash | keys: ['context_window', 'default_effort', 'efforts', 'id', 'images', 'input', 'max_tokens', 'name']\\n  efforts-ish: {'efforts': ['low', 'medium', 'high'], 'default_effort': 'high', 'images': {'cli_registry': 'explicit_unsupported', 'status': 'unsupported', 'method': None, 'proof': 'agy 1.3.1 stream-json принимает только текстовые блоки контента; image_url отвергается: error: stream input content block type \\\"image_url\\\" is not supported (only \\\"text\\\") — проверено 2026-10-07'}}\\ngemini-3.1-pro | keys: ['context_window', 'default_effort', 'efforts', 'id', 'images', 'input', 'max_tokens', 'name']\\n  efforts-ish: {'efforts': ['low', 'high'], 'default_effort': 'high', 'images': {'cli_registry': 'explicit_unsupported', 'status': 'unsupported', 'method': None, 'proof': 'agy 1.3.1 stream-json принимает только текстовые блоки контента; image_url отвергается: error: stream input content block type \\\"image_url\\\" is not supported (only \\\"text\\\") — проверено 2026-10-07'}}\\ngpt-oss-120b | keys: ['context_window', 'default_effort', 'efforts', 'id', 'images', 'input', 'max_tokens', 'name']\\n  efforts-ish: {'efforts': ['medium'], 'default_effort': 'medium', 'images': {'cli_registry': 'explicit_unsupported', 'status': 'unsupported', 'method': None, 'proof': 'agy 1.3.1 stream-json принимает только текстовые блоки контента; image_url отвергается: error: stream input content block type \\\"image_url\\\" is not supported (only \\\"text\\\") — проверено 2026-10-07'}}\\n---\\n11:        --model <MODEL_ID> --effort <EFFORT> --print-timeout=0\\n20:БАЗА (`gemini-3.8-flash`), уровень мышления — отдельная ось `--effort`; значение\\n21:берётся строго из `efforts` каталога (никаких клампов и алиасов) и передаётся\\n22:ВСЕГДА: при пустом `reasoning_effort` подставляется `default_effort`, потому что\\n23:agy отвергает базу без effort — `--model \\\"gemini-3.8-flash\\\" requires --effort\\n55:решает сразу) и proof модели в fleet.json (sha256 бинаря agy, версия метода, форматы, effort).\\n189:# Effort-оси. `--effort` у agy принимает low|medium|high; id модели — база без уровня,\\n217:# Ленивые горячие сессии: следующий запрос с тем же (модель, cwd, effort) продолжает\\n338:        efforts = item.get(\\\"efforts\\\")\\n340:            not isinstance(efforts, list)\\n341:            or not efforts\\n342:            or not all(isinstance(e, str) for e in efforts)\\n343:            or any(e not in EFFORT_LEVELS for e in efforts)\\n345:            raise FleetViolation(\\\"efforts_invalid\\\", mid)\\n346:        if item.get(\\\"default_effort\\\") not in efforts:\\n347:            raise FleetViolation(\\\"default_effort_invalid\\\", mid)\\n388:            \\\"efforts\\\": [str(e) for e in efforts],\\n389:            \\\"default_effort\\\": str(item[\\\"default_effort\\\"]),\\n468:IMAGE_LIMITS = cast(\\\"dict[str, object]\\\", cast(object, FLEET[\\\"image_limits\\\"]))\\n509:        \\\"unsupported_reasoning_effort\\\",\\n510:        \\\"invalid_reasoning_effort\\\",\\n718:def _image_proof_reason(model_id: str, effort: str | None = None) -> str | None:\\n748:    types_raw = IMAGE_LIMITS.get(\\\"types\\\")\\n756:    efforts_raw = proof.get(\\\"efforts_proven\\\")\\n757:    if not isinstance(efforts_raw, list):\\n758:        return \\\"efforts_missing\\\"\\n759:    if effort is not None and effort not in cast(\\\"list[object]\\\", efforts_raw):\\n760:        return \\\"effort_not_proven\\\"\\n774:def _image_gate(model_id: str, effort: str | None) -> ImageReject | None:\\n778:    reason = _image_proof_reason(model_id, effort)\\n783:    if reason == \\\"effort_not_proven\\\":\\n784:        return ImageReject(reason, \\\"unsupported_reasoning_effort\\\")\\n826:    value = IMAGE_LIMITS.get(name, default)\\n836:    messages: object, model_id: str, effort: str | None\\n849:    gate = _image_gate(model_id, effort)\\n859:    allowed_raw = IMAGE_LIMITS.get(\\\"types\\\")\\n2506:        effort: str,\\n2507:        effort_source: str,\\n2528:            \\\"--effort\\\",\\n2529:            effort,\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 6260,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1565,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
